  "details": "can't speak for index, can't speak for other headsets in general, but I never end up using the afk animation. Why would I ever need to hit the steam overlay button? It's a little bit much to ask for it to somehow know when I'm not wearing it and to activate but it should be possible when I hit the oculus button and am reading something on my desktop or discord to activate. \nEveryone comes right up to me, multiple times a day and asks what I'm doing when I'm busy reading something or checking something out. Or worse, they think I'm staring right at them continously for no reason. It'd see a lot more use this way.",
